<title>JAPAN: Emori - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Emori - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 18.13		vs	   16.95</p>
<p> Operating	   70    million	  vs	   86    million</p>
<p> Current	     83    million	  vs	   82    million</p>
<p> Net		   37    million	  vs	   38    million</p>
<p> EPS		    8.59 yen	  vs	    8.86 yen</p>
<p> Shares		4 million	  vs	   4 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Emori &amp; Co Ltd sells chemicals, including textile processing agents, and information equipment.</p>
